cff-version: 1.2.0
title: KV-cache compression benchmark
message: >-
  If you use this software or the results under results/, please cite the paper
  in preferred-citation rather than this repository alone.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mandlecha
    given-names: Sankalp
    alias: SankalpCG
    email: sankalp.mandlecha2003@gmail.com
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/sankalpcg/kv-compression-benchmark'
date-released: '2026-11-15'
keywords:
  - kv-cache
  - context-compression
  - long-context
  - large-language-models
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Harness and results for a controlled comparison of nine KV-cache compression
  policies against an uncompressed baseline, holding the model, the budget
  definition, the benchmark and the decode loop fixed. Covers RULER at four
  context lengths, LooGLE, and a synthetic sweep that varies the position of
  the answer span, under two prompt layouts that differ in whether the question
  is inside the compressed region.
